finally, after about 2 years after intalling nethack, i have finally 
completed a game!

  1    4206698  tom-Val-Hum-Fem-Law ascended to demigoddess-hood.     334 [334]

i had been playing a monk mostly, because its easier in the early game 
because of the initial food supply, and not having to understand the 
weapons and armors.  but all the talk about the valk being easier, i 
had to try.   so about a month ago, lawful human valk was my choice.  
dipping for Excalibur was the first priority in every game.  one game 
about 2 weeks ago, i had made it all the way back to Dlvl 1 with the 
amulet, which was also the 1st time i got out of the sanctum with it.  
Apparently i didnt notice rodney had stolen it, and with autopickup of 
" off, i unexpectedly escaped the dungeon.  For a few games after this 
, my first move in new games was Engrave "MAKE SURE YOU HAVE THE AMULET"

from the start, this definately didnt seem like a good game.  on turn 
2, i step on a teleport trap to another room on Dlvl 1. There is a 
whisle here, so i try it. my dog Max comes right next to me, but is 
instanly killed by the falling rock trap he tported onto. :(

i didnt have any luck with future pets either.  Max 2 met a sudden end 
from a homunculus.  Max 3 died within 3 turns of taming him on Mines 
End.  i lost Max 4 somewhere near the castle.

early help:  i forget the level, but early on a gelatinous cube (or a 
quvering blob, i forget) left a bag (wich turned out to be a sack) and 
a wand.  Engrave. for what do you wish?

charged it, got grey dsm & GoP.  IIRC i got a magic marker too.

sokoban provided the reflection, and i think i found the BoH in a 
minetown store.  in fact, there werent that may stores in the main 
dungeon.  rings on dlvl 4,  wand store on 6, useless armor store on 11. 
 i think there was a small scroll store that i cleaned out so i dont 
remeber where it was.  i converted one of the 2 altars in the main 
branch so i could have a place for my stuff.  here in a box i put all 
the ? and / of create monster and other junk i could find.

the valk quest is easy.  after being deathly afraid of the monk quest 
so much, this is a piece of cake.

by the time i got to medusa, i still didnt have levitation. so i dug 
down & came up the other side with my blindfold on.   the rest of the 
levels went smoothly.

as far as strategies go, i tried something i never really did before.  
i only genocided things after i really decided it was necessary.  in 
other games as soon as i got genocide, i did L T V h T right away or 
when i would first see one at least (faint wave of psychic energy).  
but this time, i decided for some dumb reason to fight these monsters 
first, and then geno them if necessary.  so i killed a bunch of liches, 
mind flayers and disenchanters before i decided i had enough.

i kept my castle /oW at (1:1) until my ascention run.  at my base camp, 
i collected everything i thought would need, digging wands, telep 
wands, gems, etc.   i had 2 wands of death, both at 1:4.  then i tried 
wishing up another /oD.  wand of fire. great, thanx RNG. i just put it 
back in my box.
so i tried the very last charge. "blessed figurine of an archon", i 
kinda had a wish to burn, i figured this couldnt hurt. i was wrong.  it 
_was_ blessed but it produced a nonpeaceful archon with Sunsword and 
something to create a dozen monsters. and then rodney showed up again :(

finally i make it up to the dlvl1 upstairs.  made sure i had the 
amulet. /oD & crystal ball ready.  the plane of earth was easy.  i 
zapped straight to the portal and then in another dumb move went away 
from it, on a killing spree.  i didnt need to, it just seemed easy 
enough.  i told myself "WHAT ARE YOU DOING?! GET ON THAT PORTAL!" so on 
i went.  my new strategy was "RUN! (if i wanted to ascend!)"   the 
other planes werent so bad if i kept moving.  on astral i tried the 
left one first, with famine in the way.  it turned out to be neutral so 
back i went to the center one, with death guarding.  i get to the altar 
finally, and its lawful! :)  but now i think i shoulda used an amulet 
of change once.

